_vintage (賣古著的）\n\n南港實習 d70   10/6\n\n如果你因為他看起來是擠擠的小店 而不進去的話\n我只能說你絕對會後悔\n店內確實擠擠的 有種在吃小吃的感覺\n剛好那天雨下的挺大\n吃麵躲雨之際 有種回家吃飯的溫暖感\n\n坐下來後 我點了一碗\n大碗的豚骨拉麵 $180\n他的大碗不只麵加量 連肉的份量也是double\n數一數 叉燒肉居然給到6塊！！\n麵的份量也非常足夠 點大碗絕對不用加麵\n就已經飽到快🈵️出來\n\n接下來來說說我給到五星的秘密\n這邊除了CP值很高 份量大滿足以外\n湯頭也十分爽口 不會太濃太鹹\n吃飽的下午完全不會有口渴的感覺\n麵的部分看似很普通\n但從上桌到我吃光的時候\n麵軟硬如一 一樣Q彈\n\n最最最值得一提的還是他的叉燒肉\n他們使用的是台灣最local的作法\n像滷紅燒肉那樣 接著切片\n但我不知道他們的秘方是什麼\n肉質軟嫩到入口即化 咀嚼幾下後有種自然的甜味 卻不是那種滷到入味的甜\n我真的很吃驚\n麵啊湯什麼的都還在意料之內並沒有太驚奇\n這肉真的不得了\n言辭很難表達那肉的厲害\n\n可以的話去試試吧\n真的是我吃過最厲害的台式拉麵之一\n又便宜\n真的直接頂穿\n\n歐對 這邊其實蠻方便的\n不要看他小小一間店\n可以line pay 好像也可以街口",null,[0,46]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13408373185812960236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjbk5UU1dSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13408373185812960236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjbk5UU1dSQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13408373185812960236/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjbk5UU1dSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13408373185812960236/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjbk5UU1dSQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13408373185812960236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjbk5UU1dSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13408373185812960236/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUmxjbk5UU1dSQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,10335,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlcnNTSWRBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x7104cfbfa317fe62!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDersSIdA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlcnNTSWRBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlcnNTSWRBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGVyc1NJOUFFEhNDZ3dJcjVpUHJBWVFxS3JpbHdFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGVyc1NJREESE0Nnd0k3SWlSbWdZUXVPSFZrQUUi